Land productivity monitoring with Landsat NDVI

This workflow adapts eight research notebooks supplied by the study author.
The supplied notebooks identify their code licence as Apache License 2.0 and
acknowledge Digital Earth Africa data and analytical tools. This declaration
and acknowledgement are retained in the documented preparation.

Digital Earth Africa Sandbox notebooks and deafrica_tools:
https://github.com/digitalearthafrica/deafrica-sandbox-notebooks

All original copyright and attribution notices apply. Data licences and
acknowledgements are separate from this code licence. Boundary and rule-table
provenance must be supplied by the researcher for an original-study release.

The example AOI is a synthetic rectangle. The example integration table is
illustrative and is not represented as the original study's decision rule.
